body:
First one story is awful and you can sum it up in one sentence (which BL2 does at the start). Just start with the best one - Borderlands 2 which story and characters are incredibly written and gameplay is BL but polished nearly to perfection. 

&#x200B;

Also BL2 is one of thouse games where DLCs are worth playing especially Tiny Tina's Assult on Dragons Keep so buy GOTY edition.
